  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb. Follows standard -AR endings throughout all tenses with no exceptions.",
    "Regular past participle: *separado*",
    "*Separar* = to separate/divide things or people. The reflexive *separarse* = to separate (a couple), to split up.",
    "*Separa la ropa blanca de la de color.* (Separate the white clothes from the coloured ones.)",
    "*La pareja se separó el año pasado.* (The couple split up last year.)",
    "Related: *separarse* (to split up/separate oneself), *la separación* (separation), *separado/a* (separated)"
  ],
